n3", "/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/selected-entry-point.py", "--state", "/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/test_run_entry_point_completes_registered_task-cqpfygrt/isolated state", "submit", "--task", "check-53b2f051a1974a5da160537658513ee7", "--attempt", "c70ad8a63b0949efb3195e2d1ac446f2", "--session", "acb38ccb46df4dd99018d7a4e10aa1ac", "--fence", "1", "--spec-rev", "1", "--commit", "FULL_COMMIT_SHA"], "prompt": "你是本地受管理任务的 worker。只执行当前 task/attempt；你不是唯一 agent，保留其他人的改动。不要改变验收 oracle、状态数据库、规格或其他任务。\ntask=check-53b2f051a1974a5da160537658513ee7 attempt=c70ad8a63b0949efb3195e2d1ac446f2 session=acb38ccb46df4dd99018d7a4e10aa1ac fence=1 spec_rev=1\nworkspace=/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/test_run_entry_point_completes_registered_task-cqpfygrt/isolated state/worktrees/c70ad8a63b0949efb3195e2d1ac446f2 base_commit=495ffc0e2c5ea776162789cac16b77567e3ec7cb\n任务说明（已冻结）：\n# Cursor pagination fixture v1\n\nThis is an isolated coding task for the Herdr A2A experiment.\n\nRun `python3 pager.py`. Read one JSON request from stdin and write one JSON response to stdout.\nRequests contain `items` (records with distinct string `id` and integer `ts`), `limit`,\nand optional `after` (null or [integer timestamp, string id]).\nSort records by (ts, id) ascending. Return at most limit records strictly after that pair.\nPreserve all record fields. Return `{\"items\": [...], \"next_cursor\": ...}`.\nThe next cursor is the last returned pair only if additional eligible records remain;\notherwise it is null. Input order must not matter. Do not mutate input records.\n\nLimits must be integers in [1, 100]; booleans are invalid. Invalid limit returns only\n`{\"error\": \"invalid_limit\"}`. An after value with a wrong shape/type returns only\n`{\"error\": \"invalid_cursor\"}`. Check limit before cursor. A cursor need not exist in the input.\nEmpty results have items=[] and next_cursor=null.\n\nThe initial program is deliberately incomplete. Implement this contract without modifying\nthis document or acceptance tools. A successful model turn is not delivery acceptance.\n\n完成本地实现后，在该 worktree 创建 commit 并保持 worktree 干净。通过 git rev-parse HEAD 获取完整 SHA，替换下面 FULL_COMMIT_SHA，精确提交一次：\npython3 /Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/selected-entry-point.py --state '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/test_run_entry_point_completes_registered_task-cqpfygrt/isolated state' submit --task check-53b2f051a1974a5da160537658513ee7 --attempt c70ad8a63b0949efb3195e2d1ac446f2 --session acb38ccb46df4dd99018d7a4e10aa1ac --fence 1 --spec-rev 1 --commit FULL_COMMIT_SHA\n成功交付只进入 submitted。不要 verify、integrate 或自行宣布 accepted。遇到权限/启动问题停止并报告；不要自动答复、重发或扩大范围。", "prompt_response": {"argv": ["herdr", "agent", "prompt", "wcheck:p3", "你是本地受管理任务的 worker。只执行当前 task/attempt；你不是唯一 agent，保留其他人的改动。不要改变验收 oracle、状态数据库、规格或其他任务。\ntask=check-53b2f051a1974a5da160537658513ee7 attempt=c70ad8a63b0949efb3195e2d1ac446f2 session=acb38ccb46df4dd99018d7a4e10aa1ac fence=1 spec_rev=1\nworkspace=/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/test_run_entry_point_completes_registered_task-cqpfygrt/isolated state/worktrees/c70ad8a63b0949efb3195e2d1ac446f2 base_commit=495ffc0e2c5ea776162789cac16b77567e3ec7cb\n任务说明（已冻结）：\n# Cursor pagination fixture v1\n\nThis is an isolated coding task for the Herdr A2A experiment.\n\nRun `python3 pager.py`. Read one JSON request from stdin and write one JSON response to stdout.\nRequests contain `items` (records with distinct string `id` and integer `ts`), `limit`,\nand optional `after` (null or [integer timestamp, string id]).\nSort records by (ts, id) ascending. Return at most limit records strictly after that pair.\nPreserve all record fields. Return `{\"items\": [...], \"next_cursor\": ...}`.\nThe next cursor is the last returned pair only if additional eligible records remain;\notherwise it is null. Input order must not matter. Do not mutate input records.\n\nLimits must be integers in [1, 100]; booleans are invalid. Invalid limit returns only\n`{\"error\": \"invalid_limit\"}`. An after value with a wrong shape/type returns only\n`{\"error\": \"invalid_cursor\"}`. Check limit before cursor. A cursor need not exist in the input.\nEmpty results have items=[] and next_cursor=null.\n\nThe initial program is deliberately incomplete. Implement this contract without modifying\nthis document or acceptance tools. A successful model turn is not delivery acceptance.\n\n完成本地实现后，在该 worktree 创建 commit 并保持 worktree 干净。通过 git rev-parse HEAD 获取完整 SHA，替换下面 FULL_COMMIT_SHA，精确提交一次：\npython3 /Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/selected-entry-point.py --state '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/test_run_entry_point_completes_registered_task-cqpfygrt/isolated state' submit --task check-53b2f051a1974a5da160537658513ee7 --attempt c70ad8a63b0949efb3195e2d1ac446f2 --session acb38ccb46df4dd99018d7a4e10aa1ac --fence 1 --spec-rev 1 --commit FULL_COMMIT_SHA\n成功交付只进入 submitted。不要 verify、integrate 或自行宣布 accepted。遇到权限/启动问题停止并报告；不要自动答复、重发或扩大范围。"], "cwd": null, "started": "2026-10-06T06:50:16.929366+00:00", "returncode": 0, "stdout": "{\"id\": \"isolated:agent_prompted\", \"result\": {\"type\": \"agent_prompted\", \"agent\": {\"pane_id\": \"wcheck:p3\", \"terminal_id\": \"isolated-term-3\", \"workspace_id\": \"wcheck\", \"tab_id\": \"wcheck:t1\", \"cwd\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T065014.400384Z-1fa93725-artifacts/test_run_entry_point_completes_registered